    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38763" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπετήσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέτειος</span>
			, <i>from year to year, yearly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					7.118
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.320.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστατεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.80
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.131d
				</span></i>
			; <i>lasting the whole year,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεσφορίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχρονίσας ἐπετήσιον</span>”
				<i>for a year,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epigr.Gr.
					815
				</span></i>
			.</div>
